Follow-up inspection: branch fix/wip-agent-stash; tracked diff spans 44 files, 876 insertions and 275 deletions; git diff --check passed. In internal/agent/ante.go unwire consumes provider and model before either config write; a second unstash failure or config write failure loses already-consumed values. internal/agent/applied.go Disconnect consumes connect.was before restoring fields. The per-operation cross-process lock does not cover the full restore, and a stale whole-map rollback can overwrite another process's successful update. stashLoad also ignores read and parse errors. filelock.Lock returns only a boolean and collapses lock errors into contention. These invariants remain unsolved; do not commit this WIP as a completed fix.

